msgstr ""
"चैलेंज एन्कोडर पढ़ें, हर फ़ील्ड का काम समझें, और देखें कि हॉट पाथ पर "
"बिना entropy syscall के पर-चैलेंज नॉनस कैसे निकाला जाता है।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/protocol.rst:52
msgid "Implementation: ``Coordinator::create_challenge_with_spec``"
msgstr "इम्प्लीमेंटेशन: ``Coordinator::create_challenge_with_spec``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/protocol.rst:54
msgid ""
"Builds the 36-byte payload, tags it under the challenge key, and "
"base64url-encodes the 52 bytes into a 70-character identifier. In "
"``crates/challenge/src/coordinator.rs`` (crate ``sibuna-challenge``)."
msgstr ""
"36-बाइट पेलोड बनाता है, उसे चैलेंज की के तहत टैग करता है, और 52 बाइट्स "
"को base64url एन्कोड करके 70 अक्षरों का आइडेंटिफ़ायर बनाता है। "
"``crates/challenge/src/coordinator.rs`` में (क्रेट "
"``sibuna-challenge``)।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/protocol.rst:56
msgid ""
"pub fn create_challenge_with_spec(\n"
"    &self,\n"
"    client_ip: &[u8],\n"
"    user_agent: &[u8],\n"
"    now: u64,\n"
"    spec: ChallengeSpec,\n"
"    rule_hash: u64,\n"
") -> Challenge {\n"
"    self.adaptive.observe(now.saturating_mul(1000));\n"
"    let effective = ChallengeSpec {\n"
"        difficulty: "
"spec.difficulty.saturating_add(self.adaptive.bump()),\n"
"        ..spec\n"
"    };\n"
"    let fingerprint = self.fingerprint(client_ip, user_agent);\n"
"    let difficulty = effective.parameter();\n"
"    let challenges = match effective.algorithm {\n"
"        Algorithm::Hashcash => 0,\n"
"        Algorithm::Posw => effective.posw_challenges,\n"
"    };\n"
"\n"
"    let mut payload = [0u8; ID_PAYLOAD_LEN];\n"
"    payload[0] = ID_VERSION;\n"
"    payload[1] = effective.algorithm.to_byte();\n"
"    payload[2] = difficulty;\n"
"    payload[3] = challenges;\n"
"    payload[4..12].copy_from_slice(&now.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[12..20].copy_from_slice(&fingerprint.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[20..28].copy_from_slice(&self.next_nonce(now, "
"fingerprint).to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[28..36].copy_from_slice(&rule_hash.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    let mut raw = [0u8; ID_RAW_LEN];\n"
"    raw[..ID_PAYLOAD_LEN].copy_from_slice(&payload);\n"
"    "
"raw[ID_PAYLOAD_LEN..].copy_from_slice(&self.challenge_tag(&payload));\n"
"\n"
"    Challenge {\n"
"        id: encoded::encode(&raw),\n"
"        algorithm: effective.algorithm,\n"
"        difficulty,\n"
"        challenges,\n"
"        expires_at: now.saturating_add(u64::from(self.challenge_ttl)),\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"pub fn create_challenge_with_spec(\n"
"    &self,\n"
"    client_ip: &[u8],\n"
"    user_agent: &[u8],\n"
"    now: u64,\n"
"    spec: ChallengeSpec,\n"
"    rule_hash: u64,\n"
") -> Challenge {\n"
"    self.adaptive.observe(now.saturating_mul(1000));\n"
"    let effective = ChallengeSpec {\n"
"        difficulty: "
"spec.difficulty.saturating_add(self.adaptive.bump()),\n"
"        ..spec\n"
"    };\n"
"    let fingerprint = self.fingerprint(client_ip, user_agent);\n"
"    let difficulty = effective.parameter();\n"
"    let challenges = match effective.algorithm {\n"
"        Algorithm::Hashcash => 0,\n"
"        Algorithm::Posw => effective.posw_challenges,\n"
"    };\n"
"\n"
"    let mut payload = [0u8; ID_PAYLOAD_LEN];\n"
"    payload[0] = ID_VERSION;\n"
"    payload[1] = effective.algorithm.to_byte();\n"
"    payload[2] = difficulty;\n"
"    payload[3] = challenges;\n"
"    payload[4..12].copy_from_slice(&now.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[12..20].copy_from_slice(&fingerprint.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[20..28].copy_from_slice(&self.next_nonce(now, "
"fingerprint).to_le_bytes());\n"
"    payload[28..36].copy_from_slice(&rule_hash.to_le_bytes());\n"
"    let mut raw = [0u8; ID_RAW_LEN];\n"
"    raw[..ID_PAYLOAD_LEN].copy_from_slice(&payload);\n"
"    "
"raw[ID_PAYLOAD_LEN..].copy_from_slice(&self.challenge_tag(&payload));\n"
"\n"
"    Challenge {\n"
"        id: encoded::encode(&raw),\n"
"        algorithm: effective.algorithm,\n"
"        difficulty,\n"
"        challenges,\n"
"        expires_at: now.saturating_add(u64::from(self.challenge_ttl)),\n"
"    }\n"
"}"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/protocol.rst:100
msgid ""
"The identifier is an ``Encoded<70>``: the text lives in an array of "
"exactly its length, so issuing a challenge never allocates. "
"``ChallengeSpec::parameter`` maps work bits to the tier's own unit, "
"Hashcash bits (at most 64) or PoSW depth (``difficulty - 3``, clamped to "
"4 through 24)."
msgstr ""
"आइडेंटिफ़ायर एक ``Encoded<70>`` है: टेक्स्ट ठीक अपनी लंबाई के ऐरे में "
"रहता है, इसलिए चैलेंज जारी करने में कभी मेमोरी अलोकेशन नहीं होता। "
"``ChallengeSpec::parameter`` वर्क बिट्स को टियर की अपनी यूनिट में मैप "
"करता है — Hashcash बिट्स (अधिकतम 64) या PoSW गहराई (``difficulty - 3``, "
"4 से 24 के बीच क्लैम्प)।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/protocol.rst:102
msgid "Three details deserve attention:"
msgstr "तीन बातें ध्यान देने लायक हैं:"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/protocol.rst:104
msgid ""
"*Adaptive difficulty.* The coordinator keeps an exponentially weighted "
"moving average of the challenge issue rate in three atomics. Above a "
"baseline of 50 challenges per second, each doubling of the rate adds one "
"work bit, capped at six. A flood pays exponentially more while quiet "
"traffic keeps the base cost."
msgstr ""
"*एडैप्टिव कठिनाई।* कोऑर्डिनेटर तीन एटॉमिक्स में चैलेंज जारी होने की दर "
"का exponentially weighted moving average रखता है। प्रति सेकंड 50 चैलेंज "
"की बेसलाइन से ऊपर, दर हर बार दोगुनी होने पर एक वर्क बिट जुड़ जाता है "
"(अधिकतम छह)। फ़्लड ट्रैफ़िक को घातीय रूप से ज़्यादा कीमत चुकानी पड़ती "
"है, जबकि सामान्य ट्रैफ़िक बेस कॉस्ट पर रहता है।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/protocol.rst:105
msgid ""
"*The nonce is a PRF output*, keyed by the challenge key over a counter, "
"the clock, and the fingerprint. It is unique (counter) and unpredictable "
"(key), so an adversary cannot precompute solutions for identifiers it has "
"not been issued, and the hot path never calls into the operating system "
"for entropy."
msgstr ""
"*नॉनस एक PRF आउटपुट है*, जिसे चैलेंज की से काउंटर, क्लॉक और "
"फ़िंगरप्रिंट पर निकाला जाता है। यह यूनिक (काउंटर) और अप्रत्याशित (की) "
"होता है, इसलिए हमलावर उन आइडेंटिफ़ायर्स के हल पहले से नहीं निकाल सकता "
"जो उसे जारी नहीं हुए, और हॉट पाथ को entropy के लिए कभी ऑपरेटिंग सिस्टम "
"कॉल नहीं करना पड़ता।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/protocol.rst:106
msgid ""
"*Difficulty travels inside the tag.* A client cannot lower the difficulty "
"by editing the record: the tag would fail before any proof is examined."
msgstr ""
"*कठिनाई टैग के अंदर बँधी रहती है।* क्लाइंट रिकॉर्ड एडिट करके कठिनाई कम "
"नहीं कर सकता: कोई भी प्रूफ़ जाँचे जाने से पहले ही टैग फ़ेल हो जाएगा।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/protocol.rst:108
msgid "Verification Order and Single Use"
msgstr "वेरिफ़िकेशन का क्रम और सिंगल-यूज़"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/protocol.rst:113
msgid ""
"Understand why the cheap checks run before the proof, why the challenge "
